---
// Member-facing Contact section. Rendered both as a standalone page
// (/account/contact) and inside the side-drawer on /account.
//
// Different cards for different needs so members can flag what they're
// asking about without writing a subject line themselves — each mailto
// pre-fills subject + a short greeting so we can route on our end.
---

<div class="acc-section">
  <header class="acc-section-head">
    <p class="acc-section-eyebrow">Contact</p>
    <h2 class="acc-section-title">How can we help?</h2>
    <p class="acc-section-sub">Pick the line that fits — your message lands in the right inbox with the right context attached, so you get a quicker reply.</p>
  </header>

  <div class="acc-contact-grid">
    <a class="acc-contact-card" href="mailto:hello@tmke.co.uk?subject=Quick%20question">
      <span class="acc-contact-card-tag">Anything</span>
      <h3 class="acc-contact-card-title">Quick question</h3>
      <p class="acc-contact-card-desc">For everything that doesn't fit the other cards. Same-day reply during UK working hours.</p>
      <span class="acc-contact-card-cta">hello@tmke.co.uk <em>&rarr;</em></span>
    </a>

    <a class="acc-contact-card" href="mailto:packs@tmke.co.uk?subject=Pack%20support&body=Hi%20team%2C%0A%0APack%20name%3A%20%0AIssue%3A%20">
      <span class="acc-contact-card-tag">Packs</span>
      <h3 class="acc-contact-card-title">Pack support</h3>
      <p class="acc-contact-card-desc">Missing assets, a file that won't open, a typo on a template — anything pack-related.</p>
      <span class="acc-contact-card-cta">packs@tmke.co.uk <em>&rarr;</em></span>
    </a>

    <a class="acc-contact-card" href="mailto:hello@tmke.co.uk?subject=Managed%20socials%20enquiry&body=Hi%20team%2C%0A%0AI'd%20like%20to%20chat%20about%20you%20managing%20our%20channel.%20A%20bit%20about%20us%3A%0A%0A">
      <span class="acc-contact-card-tag">Done-for-you</span>
      <h3 class="acc-contact-card-title">Managed socials enquiry</h3>
      <p class="acc-contact-card-desc">Thinking about handing the channel over? We'll book a 20-minute call to walk you through how it works.</p>
      <span class="acc-contact-card-cta">Start the conversation <em>&rarr;</em></span>
    </a>

    <a class="acc-contact-card" href="mailto:billing@tmke.co.uk?subject=Billing%20query&body=Hi%20team%2C%0A%0AInvoice%20number%3A%20%0AQuery%3A%20">
      <span class="acc-contact-card-tag">Billing</span>
      <h3 class="acc-contact-card-title">Billing &amp; invoices</h3>
      <p class="acc-contact-card-desc">VAT receipts, refunds, payment method changes. We aim to come back within one working day.</p>
      <span class="acc-contact-card-cta">billing@tmke.co.uk <em>&rarr;</em></span>
    </a>

    <a class="acc-contact-card" href="mailto:hello@tmke.co.uk?subject=Feedback%20on%20the%20platform&body=Hi%20team%2C%0A%0AWhat's%20working%20well%3A%20%0AWhat%20I'd%20love%20to%20see%3A%20">
      <span class="acc-contact-card-tag">Roadmap</span>
      <h3 class="acc-contact-card-title">Feedback &amp; feature ideas</h3>
      <p class="acc-contact-card-desc">Tell us what's getting in your way and what you'd love us to build next. Members shape the roadmap.</p>
      <span class="acc-contact-card-cta">Share an idea <em>&rarr;</em></span>
    </a>

    <a class="acc-contact-card acc-contact-card--soft" href="mailto:hello@tmke.co.uk?subject=Press%20%26%20partnerships">
      <span class="acc-contact-card-tag">Press</span>
      <h3 class="acc-contact-card-title">Press &amp; partnerships</h3>
      <p class="acc-contact-card-desc">Speaking, podcasts, agency partnerships, anything that isn't day-to-day support.</p>
      <span class="acc-contact-card-cta">hello@tmke.co.uk <em>&rarr;</em></span>
    </a>
  </div>

  <footer class="acc-section-foot">
    <span class="acc-section-foot-tag">Studio hours</span>
    Mon&ndash;Fri, 09:00&ndash;17:30 GMT. Out of hours, we'll pick it up first thing.
  </footer>
</div>
